# The image ships without a machine ID, so on first boot systemd enables units
# from its upstream presets. NetworkManager manages the network here: keep
# systemd-networkd off, or both manage the same interfaces and
# systemd-networkd-wait-online stalls the boot for 2 minutes. homed is unused.
disable systemd-networkd*
disable systemd-network-generator.service
disable systemd-homed*
